  "prompt": "Trong không gian <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, cho ba điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là điểm thỏa mãn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đạt giá trị nhỏ nhất. Tính tổng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.",
