  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tPhương trình mặt phẳng trung trực của đoạn thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> nằm về một phía so với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, suy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> nằm về hai phía so với (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math>).<br>\n\t\tĐiểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> thỏa mãn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tKhi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br> \n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nhỏ nhất bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tPhương trình đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>\n\t\tDo đó tọa độ điểm M là nghiệm của hệ phương trình <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>\n\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, do đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
